sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.attendance.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee AttendanceController"
    participant Model as "Attendance Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Export (PDF/Excel/CSV)
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/attendance/export?filter&format
    Controller->>Model: Build periode + filter status/search
    Model->>DB: SELECT data absensi pegawai sesuai filter
    DB-->>Model: Dataset untuk ekspor
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap file export

    alt Data valid (format valid & data tersedia)
        Controller->>View: Return file pdf/xlsx/csv
        View-->>Pegawai: File absensi berhasil diunduh
    else Data tidak valid (worker tidak ada/filter/format error)
        Controller->>View: Redirect/back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal ekspor absensi
    end
